window.products.push({"id":373047,"name":"2-in-ONE Digital Timer (Count-Down) / Stopwatch (Count-Up) with Blue LED Light & Beeps Notification Large Easy-Push Button Mute & Lock Functions Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zt22StMiL._AC_SL1385_.jpg","description":"🔳《ENHANCED 2 FUNCTIONS》 It has two functions; Digital Timer (Count-Down) / Stopwatch (Count-Up). When using the Timer it tells you with BLUE LED light and a beep when the designated time is up. Also it has a special function which starts count-up after you stop count-down. Operation sound can be muted in public places. This timer has a repeat function. After stopping the alarm sound, the original setting time is displayed. 🔳《EASY PUSH START / END BUTTONS》 This item is used for many ways to set time, such as exercising, cooking, study, gaming or playing for children. The large START / END button blinks with BLUE LED light when the designated time is up. Also the 45 degree angle is designed so that the screen is also easy to see when viewed in a sitting position. 🔳《UNIQUE BLUE LED LIGHT NOTIFICATION》 When the designated time is up, the BLUE LED light blinks. Why BLUE color? In psychology, blue is a color that makes it easy to relax and concentrate. This item might be good for students to study, or useful for anyone during the meditation. 🔳《MUTE & LOCK FUNCTION》 Easy to activate the lock to prevent any errors or unexpected operations especially when carrying the timer in your pocket or bag. Volume has 3 selections, HIGH / LOW / SILENT. Silent mode is useful in quiet environments. 🔳《PRODUCT DETAILS》 Maximum setting time: 199 minutes 50 seconds. Size:5.9\"(15cm) X 4.9\"(12.4cm) X 2.1\"(5.4cm). Weight:5.6 oz","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zt22StMiL._AC_SL1385_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"dretec","source_asin":"B092HDXGCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092HDXGCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092HDXGCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
