window.products.push({"id":373052,"name":"Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set - USB Rechargeable,LED Light,Adjustable Coarseness,TEITOP Automatic Pepper and Salt Mill Grinder Set with Chargin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nVeT+HmTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Upgraded Design】TEITOP Electric salt and pepper grinder set easy to use, press the button you can get fine salt and pepper you want. Perfect curve design makes the appearance fashionable. Built-in rechargeable lithium battery, so no additional battery is required. When pepper and salt grinder requires charging, you can just put it on the charging base. The grinder can be placed on the base all the time, and will automatically power off after being fully charged, without worrying about overcharging. ✅【Adjustable Grinding Coarseness】Ceramic grinding core grinds spices and salt more steadily and finely, twist the knob on the bottom of the grinder to set the coarseness you want, and easily control the spice grinding from coarse to ultra-fine. Great for grinding sea salt, black pepper, white pepper and other spices. ✅【Circular Transparent Window】You can easily distinguish every spice and condiment through the circular transparent window, without confusing. Additionally, the design of LED light can not only show you the amount of the salt and pepper you put in, but also accurately present the storage area to you. ✅【High-Quality Material】The rechargeable salt and pepper mill is made of food grade materials, hand well and won't freeze your hands in winter. ✅【Ideal Gift】The automatic grinder elegant design and exquisite gift box of this pepper grinders make it a great gift for any occasion.The grinder perfect for cooking, grilling, or outdoor picnics. It will be a suitable gift for Christmas, anniversaries, Father's Day, Mother's Day, birthdays, and other holidays. ✅【Accessories】Rechargeable base, wooden spoon, cleaning brush, USB charging cable, dustproof cover. The dustproof cover can close the container so that the spices can stay fresh for a long time, and at the same time, it won't dirty your backpack when you carry it to outdoor activities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nVeT+HmTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEITOP","source_asin":"B0BY4NX5CJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY4NX5CJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY4NX5CJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
