window.products.push({"id":373071,"name":"All-Clad D3 3-Ply Stainless Steel Dutch Oven 5.5 Quart Induction Oven Broil Safe 600F Pots and Pans, Cookware","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ejc1JuLyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Dutch Oven, or what the French call une cocotte, is probably the most competent cookware piece in the kitchen. It’s deep enough to braise, stew, or slow cook from the stovetop to the oven. As part of our D3 Collection, this Dutch Oven features a bonded tri-ply construction made with a responsive aluminum core pressed together with 2 layers of durable, stainless steel all the way around the surface, for fast and even heat.  At 5.5 quarts, it’s the perfect size for making a hearty meal for a group.  To keep your All-Clad looking brand new, we recommend washing your cookware with a soap and sponge instead of the dishwasher. Like all our bonded cookware, it's handmade in the USA at our Canonsburg, PA factory with ultra-durable materials that'll last a lifetime and never go out of style. Handles & handle loops are made in China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ejc1JuLyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B004T6J7TQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004T6J7TQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004T6J7TQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
