window.products.push({"id":373153,"name":"CoTa Global Cool Chili Peppers Refrigerator Bobble Magnets Set of 3 - Assorted Color Fun Cute Chili Bobble Head Magnets for Kitchen Fridge Door, Home ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41oloha-doL._AC_.jpg","description":"THE COOL CHILI PEPPER BOBBLE MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Bring out the kid in you and display your cute collection of magnets! Play with the bobble magnets whenever you are bored, stressed or taking time off. CoTa Global's Cool Chili Pepper Bobble Fridge Magnets will surely entertain anyone who sees the cute magnets bobble with just a tap. A must-have magnetic home and office accessory to use as convenient noteholders. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNETS ARE FOR WHIMSICAL NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home and office ornament for magnet collectors and spicy food lovers who'd like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique decorative bobble magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures or random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones or to post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Includes CoTa Global Assorted Color Set of 3 Cool Chili Pepper Bobble Fridge Magnets. The magnets feature colorful peppers standing upright wearing cool sunglasses and mustaches. The bobble magnetic decor set features realistic details and colored with vibrant colors making them the perfect accent for plain-colored refrigerators. Cute kitchen fridge magnets measure about 4 inches long. HIGH-QUALITY SPICY FOOD BOBBLE HEAD MAGNETS – Fun magnets for refrigerator are made of premium quality plastic construction, durable springs, and strong magnet attached to the back of each 3D-shaped cool chili pepper figure. The cool peppers are connected to durable springs that make them bobble and bounce as you open and close the refrigerator door. Make the magnets shake by gently tapping the beautifully designed cool chili peppers. IDEAL USE FOR THE CHILI PEPPER REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboards, cabinet and any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Pepper magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge and an amusing locker decor to help in posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos and drawings. Perfect set of functional multi-use magnets for the home or any office work-space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41oloha-doL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CoTa Global","source_asin":"B08DL6KR5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DL6KR5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DL6KR5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
