window.products.push({"id":373165,"name":"GEHARTY Projection Digital Alarm Clock, 160° Rotatable Projector, 4-Level Dimmer, AC & Battery Operated, USB Phone Charging Port, Large LED Screen, Du","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JLlR9RGBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This creative, intelligent and convenient projection alarm clock is the best gift for children and parents. Double alarm clock makes children get up more actively, whlie soft red projection protects children's eyes. And large LED digital screen is convenient for the elderly to check the time. Alarm clock is used instead of mobile phone to keep away from radiation during sleep and ensure sleep quality. Projection Function ♦ The projection lamp on the right side of the product can project the current time and temperature of the clock on the wall or roof in order to watch the time at night, if the projection direction is not correct, press the button to switch the display direction. ♦ The suggested distance of projection on ceiling or wall is 6.6 ~ 16.4 ft (2 ~ 5 m) . The projection lamp holder can rotate 160°.Press the button and hold it down for about 3 seconds the projection image will flip 180°. ♦ When using the USB cable, you can select the projection lamp to stay lit or not lit by the ON/OFF switch on the back of the product. When the battery is powered, you can also use this switch to select whether or not the projection light is switched on at the same time as the backlight. Automatic Snooze Function ♦ Proceed as follows to activate the automatic Snooze function: While the alarm is sounding, touch the button to activate snooze function. Then Snooze function is active.or icon twinkle on the display. ♦ This operation moves the alarm back by 5 minutes and the alarm will restart at this time. ♦The Snooze function can be interrupted by pressing any button. Backlight ♦ At any time, touch the button will light the backlight for 8 seconds. ♦ In the case of using the USB cable, the product's backlight will have 4 brightness mode, light - medium - low - out, each touch one time to switch one mode. °C/°F Temperature Display/Humidity Display ☼ The temperature is displayed either in °C or °F. Pressing the “-” button","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JLlR9RGBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GEHARTY","source_asin":"B07Z8YCLKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z8YCLKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z8YCLKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":373166,"name":"Insul-Bright Insulated Lining 36 x 45 Inches - 2 Packs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sH90esS8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Needle-punched, insulating material ideal for home sewers and crafters. With today's focus shifting back to family and home, new and experienced sewers are choosing simple, practical projects for use in their homes or as gifts. Pot holders, oven mitts, lunch bags, water heater cover, ironing board cover and casserole covers are all projects made functional and safe with Insul-Bright. The needled material is breathable and won't break down with washing. The hollow fibers resist conduction while the reflective metalized poly film resists radiant energy. The energy, hot or cold, is reflected back to its source. This 8x12 in package contains 36x45 in insulated lining. NOTE: This fill is heat resistant not heat proof. Machine wash and tumble dry. Made in USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sH90esS8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Warm Company Steam-A-Seam","source_asin":"B08W2HB9TP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W2HB9TP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W2HB9TP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
