window.products.push({"id":373171,"name":"Normcore 2 Packs 53.3mm Puck Screen with Stand - Reusable Contact Shower Screen with Silicone Holder - 1.7mm / 1.0mm Thickness 150μm Mesh - Compatible","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91avrR6OatL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To be placed on top of your tamped coffee bed, the Normcore Puck Screen helps to create a softer and more evenly distributed water flow for your puck. It not only helps with reduced channeling but also improves extraction. Best of all, it is keeping your brew head (due to minimal contact with coffee grounds) as well as the basket clean and tidy. Coffee pucks will be more compacted and can be knocked out in one piece without messing around. With a filter fineness of 150 microns, this shower puck screen promotes the full extraction of your coffee grounds. 1.7mm（Most Popular) or 1mm thickness? It is recommended to choose a thickness of 1.7mm when the coffee ground dose is normal, which does not affect the normal extraction. When the coffee ground dose is larger and very fine, it is recommended to choose a thickness of 1mm puck screen. Advanced selection： Due to the fiber density of dark roast beans being higher than light/medium roast, therefore even with the same weight in grams, the volume of dark roast beans is higher than light/medium roast. It is recommended to choose a thickness of 1mm for dark roast beans, while 1.7mm thickness for light/medium roast. THE SPECIFICS： - Diameter: 53.3mm - Material: 316 Stainless Steel mesh - Filtration Mesh Size: 150µm - Thickness: 1.7mm / 1.0mm CARE INSTRUCTIONS: - Wash thoroughly with water after use. - Clean with Cafiza or a blast from the steam wand if the product is stained. THE INCLUDES : 1 - Normcore Puck Screen - 1.7mm Thickness 1 - Normcore Puck Screen - 1.0mm Thickness 1 - Normcore Puck Screen Stand","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91avrR6OatL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Normcore","source_asin":"B0BC6JXTL7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC6JXTL7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC6JXTL7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
