window.products.push({"id":373263,"name":"Home Brew Heat Heating Belt Pad for Beer Wine Spirits fermenter +Thermometer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IoLnh4VHL._SL1493_.jpg","description":"This easy to use heat pad is designed to keep your brew warm enough for a consistent fermentation at a low cost, as it is only 25 watt. It raises the temperature of 3-11℃ above the ambient temperature. The PVC surface is water proof (but the pad is not suitable to use in liquid). An internal temperature safety will shut off the power if the heat pad surface temperature is higher than 50 (+/- 5) ℃. There are two fire resistant cotton sheets beneath the PVC cover. The heating wire is double insulated. For illustration, see Pic 2 above. It is 30cm (12'') in diameter and is safe for use with both glass and plastic fermenters, carboys and buckets. It is easy to clean by wiping off and easy to store. Improve the quality of your beer and wine whilst reducing fermentation time with this electric heating pad. It is perfect to use if you need to keep your brew in a spare room, garage of cellar where the temperature is lower than the ideal for brewing. Please note that there is no temperature controller on the mat, so regular check is required to ensure the proper temperature being maintained. One free stick-on thermometer is included in the package. Please notice that the liquid temperature is about 0.5-1.5 ℃ lower than the temperature shown on the stick-on thermometer on the container.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IoLnh4VHL._SL1493_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hopsbrew","source_asin":"B082FFXC1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082FFXC1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082FFXC1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":373264,"name":"Stock Your Home 16 oz Glass Jars with Plastic Caps (12 Pack) - Reusable Food Grade Glass Bottles - Dishwasher Safe - Leak-Proof Lids - Travel Bottle f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KfjYVi79L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made in the USA: Made of premium quality, lead-free glass material, our 16 oz jars with caps are perfect for storing smoothies, green juices, protein shakes, almond milk, oat milk, and more! Our jars are the perfect travel size to pack for lunch, gym, pool, beach, school, work, camping, and hiking. Our value pack comes with 6 glass bottles and 6 black plastic caps. Each milk bottle has a capacity of 16 ounces. Dimensions are approximately 6.63” Height, 2.63” Diameter. Leak-Proof Caps: Our black 63mm 63-400 PP caps are made with a ribbed sided design to make unscrewing and securing the lid easy. Each cap has a F217 PE foamed liner, making them leak-proof and spill resistant. The tight seal keeps beverages fresh and long lasting. It also keeps bad-odors from permeating the contents of the bottle. Our caps are *Not* dishwasher safe. Dishwasher Safe Bottles: Our glass jars are dishwasher safe and even easy to clean by hand. Simply wash with warm water, mild dish soap and a non-abrasive sponge to get your jars squeaky clean! You’ll never have to worry about our glass bottles warping from heat like cheap plastic bottles. It’s also stain and odor resistant. You can be sure that our glass bottle will last for years to come. The caps are *Not* dishwasher safe. Multipurpose & Versatile: Our multipurpose jars can be used as storage for bathroom accessories like bath salts and bath bubble soap. Use them in your kitchen to store honey, spaghetti sauce, olives, and asparagus. You can get creative and use our milk bottles to make candles or unique party favors. The possibilities are endless! Eco-Friendly: Our crystal clear glass jars are a great alternative to acrylic and plastic bottles. Unlike plastic, our glass bottles won’t leach BPA or phthalates into your food. Our juice bottles are also recyclable and reusable. By using our jars you’ll help reduce toxic emissions, overall benefiting the environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KfjYVi79L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stock Your Home","source_asin":"B0BGQBM9HK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGQBM9HK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGQBM9HK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":373265,"name":"Large Glow in The Dark Blanket w Free Glow Stickers | Heart Blanket | Glow in Dark Blanket| Glow in The Dark Blankets for Girls| Soft Blanket for Teen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I4jYfE4lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get The Kids Excited For Bedtime How many of us remember being excited for nap time and bedtime as kids? Whether you are a parent, aunt, uncle, grandparent or babysitter, you probably know the struggle. Nap time and bedtime are exciting parts of the day for many adults - those of us that do get naps. Our kids, however, have a different opinion. Make nap time and bed time a pleasant experience for children and parents alike with this ultra-soft moon and star glow in the dark blanket. This moon and star bedding and throw blankets for kids provides a unique and comforting nighttime experience for kids who hate going to sleep and staying asleep and can provide peace of mind to parents with children who experience fear of the dark or night terrors. *BONUS* This glow in the dark blanket also comes with 3D glow in the dark star stickers. These stickers are long lasting and could be a fun activity to set up around the bedroom or to add to your own room for those nights the kids find themselves in your bed. The stickers are high quality and the glow lasts all night. Because these are over sized, they will be the perfect gift for any age. Ultra-Soft Large Glow In The Dark Blanket - 60 X 80\" Ultra-Soft Large Glow In The Dark Blanket - 60 X 80\" Comes With 633 3D Glow In The Dark Star Stickers – 3d Comes With 633 3D Glow In The Dark Star Stickers – 3d Fits A Twin or Full Size Bed Fits A Twin or Full Size Bed Non-Scratchy Skin Friendly Material For All Ages Non-Scratchy Skin Friendly Material For All Ages When Exposed To Bright Light, Glow Will Last All Night When Exposed To Bright Light, Glow Will Last All Night Machine Washable Machine Washable 100% Polyester 100% Polyester Doubles As Glow In The Dark Throw Blanket Use this magic glow in the dark blanket to get the family together for movie nights. Perfect for dimming the lights and watching movies with the family. Especially useful for children who are afraid of the dark. Give your child peace of mind during dark movies and spend a little extra time with the ones you love most.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I4jYfE4lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Perfect Picks","source_asin":"B08KRH2L6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KRH2L6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KRH2L6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
