window.products.push({"id":373273,"name":"Home-X 3 Pcs Rotating Handbag Hanger for Closet, Purse Organizers, Closet Organizers, Handbag Storage, Purse Hanging Closet Hooks-Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kqsSgbzyL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Purses can be tricky to store. Their odd, bulky shape takes up a lot of space on your closet's shelves. Fortunately, our purse hangers offer a neat and tidy storage solution for your bags. These purse hangers are designed to go on your closet rod. They act like normal hangers, sliding easily along the rod. On either side of the hanger, there's a small component that is contoured to hold the straps of your bags. With your purchase, you'll get 3 purse hangers, and each purse hanger can hold up to 2 bags! Collectively, they can hold 6 purses. Use it to store purses, backpacks, and other types of bags. No longer will your closet feel cluttered or crowded, thanks to these purse hooks. These purse hangers are made from strong, durable plastic. They won't bend or break under the weight of heavier bags, so you'll be able to use them for years to come. These purse hangers work great in any type of closet, whether it's a small one or a walk-in one. Additionally, they're great for small spaces, like little homes and apartments where saving space is vital. Put them in either a bedroom closet or a coat closet. These purse hangers offer easy access to all your bags, allowing you to quickly sort through them and decide which bag you want to use for the day. Do you know someone who could use these purse hangers? They make a great gift for birthdays, Christmas, special occasions, housewarming parties, weddings, and more. Get them for a friend or family member. They'll appreciate your thoughtfulness in getting them such a useful gift. Whether you get these hangers for yourself or a friend, they're sure to offer effective purse storage and organization. Add them to your home supplies today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kqsSgbzyL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B081FHF5S1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081FHF5S1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081FHF5S1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
