window.products.push({"id":373469,"name":"Bread Box, G.a HOMEFAVOR Extra Large Metal Bread Bin with Bamboo Lid, High Capacity Bread Storage Bin for Kitchen Countertop, Holds 2+ Loaves, 13\"*7.5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X9Cn5BB2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FREE TO BREATH AND KEEP BREAD FRESH - Bread need free breath to keep crust crisp. Some other breadbox has a tight seal to stop air ventilation which only increased the rate of moisture and make your bread soft and doughy quickly. Our bread box has a bamboo lid without tight seal, so the moisture from bread could flow out and keep the box inner bread fresh for a long time. Never need to worry your bread goes stale quickly! SMART SLIDE HANDLES DESIGN MAKE YOU MORE CONFIDENT - This sturdy breadbox has two solid handles which made for carrying in case of dropping. Unlike other bread boxes without handles, you must carry the box and usually leave some sticky fingerprints or smudges easily. Choose our bread box, you will avoid embarrassing fingerprints! PERFECT SIZE FOR YOUR BREAD AND KITCHEN COUNTER - This cute bread box's space is 13*7.5*10 inches which is enough for you to carry kinds of Sandwich and Muffin (2+ loaf of bread). It is perfect for your space-limited kitchen counter. THE BAMBOO LID NOT ONLY A BAMBOO LID - The bamboo lid is not only a lid to ensure the air circulation and keep bread fresh, but also could be as a cutting board which you can slice your bread on it and never need to worry the bread crumbs scattered your table. Because after your slicing, put the lid back to the box top and the crumbs also back to your box! BUILT TO LAST AND IDEAL FOR A GIFT - Our bread box is made of durable powder-coated steel that is anti-rust and great storage. Choose our Large bread box as a gift is your best choice!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X9Cn5BB2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G.a HOMEFAVOR","source_asin":"B08LB7FQVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LB7FQVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LB7FQVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
