window.products.push({"id":373507,"name":"VEKOID Metal Coat Rack with 9 Hooks, Freestanding coat racks with Natural Marble Base, Entryway Black Hall Tree Bedroom Clothes Hanger Hat Rack Stand,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":76.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-Q9k0N9uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Creative & Neoteric Freestanding Coat Rack ➤ Our coat rack stand is personalized design as a simulated tree, its naturally curved main pole and the spreading branches, add lots of vivid vitality to the item. This freestanding coat rack make it more beautiful and add more artistic flair to your home. When placed in the entryway or the living room, it will make your home more tidy and elegant. Get You An Organized Space ➤ This coat tree has multiple functions, which can be used as coat rack, hat rack, bag rack, towel rack. 9 hooks are enough to organize families' clothes, coats, bags, hats, scarves, umbrellas, etc.. Each hook can support up to 13 pounds (maximum total load: 120 pounds). The modern coat rack is suitable for various scenes such as entryway, living room, bedroom, office, bathroom and so on. Weighted Natural Marble Base ➤The coat hanger stand base is processed and polished from natural marble, retains the natural texture. The bottom is reinforced and upgraded, ensures its strong load bearing, takes into account the beauty of the overall appearance, but also greatly improves the efficiency of the use of the rack stand. Superior Materials and Workmanship ➤ This metal coat rack is made of high-quality carbon steel with a matte black powder coating, which is durable and rust-resistant. The wood branches head is smoother without burrs, which will not damage the clothes. The structure of this vertical coat rack is very stable and will not collapse easily. Easy To Assemble ➤ No tools required. The coat rack is equipped with metal screw holes. You can assemble it with our assembly instruction manual in just a few minutes. AFTER-SALE SERVICE: If you receive a cracked base, contact us online , we can send you free replacement . Any other quality issue we will offer you satisfied solution in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-Q9k0N9uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEKOID","source_asin":"B0B71VLQMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B71VLQMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B71VLQMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":373508,"name":"Mr. Heater 175,000-BTU Forced-Air Kerosene Heater, F270370 MH175KTR","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+Tirz6WtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Mr. Heater 175,000 BTU Forced Air Kerosene Heater. Safe, easy warmth for when the temperature drops. Convert your garage, barn, or tool shed into a year-round workspace! This Mr. Heater Forced Air Kerosene Heater delivers up to 175,000 BTUs of chill-chasing warmth when you're working on your truck, farm equipment, ATV and more. Heats approximately 4,250 sq. ft.. Runs up to 10 hours on a full tank. 13.4 gallon fuel tank. Easy-off access panel and side lift handles. Troubleshooting diagnostics with LED indicator. Overheat safety shut-off. Thermostat. CSA Certified.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+Tirz6WtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr. Heater","source_asin":"B07M6J7C1T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M6J7C1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M6J7C1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":373509,"name":"Heka Naturals Elite Shungite Pendant, Tumbled Pendant & Single Stone | Natural Crystal for Water Purification, Mineralization, Detoxification, Noble C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hbed0jGsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💠 MULTIPURPOSE | Elite, Noble Type I Shungite is the purest type, it contains from 95% to 100% carbon which makes it ideal for water purification and can be used for a variety of things, from the physical to the metaphysical. Elite Shungite purifies and mineralizes water the way mother nature intended, it helps physically as an anti-inflammatory, anti-allergy, antioxidant, and absorbent of negative substances from the environment. They are also perfect as home decorations or aquarium decor. 🪨 STRAIGHT FROM MOTHER EARTH | If you like our Shungite, you’ll positively adore our Elite Shungite stone necklace! Our master artisans use Shungite to bring you various pendants which come in symbolic shapes, or with symbolic engravings, but even they don’t dare blemish the purity of Elite Shungite. Elite Shungite is on a near Divine level of purity, as such our necklaces come as natural as possible to preserve all of Shungites power for you to experience from this gorgeous natural stone. 🌊 WATER PURIFIER | While our Elite Shungite water filter crystal is great as a multipurpose decor, and gift of goodwill, it is actually best used for one purpose - as a water purifier crystal. The high carbon content of Shungite is the perfect water filter. Beside cleaning your water of impurities, it can also help you balance your mental and physical state. For best practices, clean your Shungite by boiling it for 10 - 15 minutes. Once cool, place the rocks in water, 50-70g / 1L - overnight. 🎓 THE SCIENCE BEHIND THE STONE | What does science say about Shungite and Fullerenes? If you're interested to learn more about Shungite and its medical applications, you can do so by searching for the following PMCIDs with a simple Google search: PMC2676811 | \"Medicinal applications of fullerenes\" and PMC5574306 | \"Antioxidant and Anti-Inflammatory Effects of Shungite...\" These are both articles published by the National Center for Biotechnology Information. 🎀 MEMORABLE GIFT OF PURITY | Made with lots of love and care, this black crystal set is the perfect gift for any special person in your life. They will be happy to get it from you for any occasion be it a birthday, anniversary, or any special day. Shungite necklace charms have a long history of being gifted as a token of goodwill, health, love, and perseverance. While wearing this authentic gemstone pendant, you and your loved one will feel protected through all of life's journeys.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hbed0jGsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heka Naturals","source_asin":"B07DX6ZJWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DX6ZJWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DX6ZJWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
