window.products.push({"id":373530,"name":"Yewader Chenille Bath Rug Extra Soft and Absorbent Shaggy Bathroom Mats Carpet Non Slip Toilet Mat (20''x 30'', Yellow)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CXzCM7lSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our bath mat offers a rare combination of comfort and luxury; it is super soft, soaks up moisture, and designed to last for years through heavy use and machine washing Your bath mat is the first thing your body touches after leaving the shower or bath, so it's worth treating your feet to one you really like. 's lush bath rug set covers all the bases with its soft, quick-drying material and anti-skid layer. Place them outside of your bath tub or shower to provide a soft, water-absorbent solution or in front of your vanity to give bare feet a cushy feel. Microfiber is renowned for its outstanding absorbing abilities and therefor our mat is perfect for bathrooms with heavy traffic because it will dry quickly. These rugs are available in 4 different colors to coordinate with any bathroom. Designed to last for years, the rugs won't shrink or turn rough after being washed. It won't fade with continue use. making it a safe choice for kids, toddlers and adults. With so many benefits, it's a great additional to any bathroom! Features: - Material: Microfiber Chenille - Size: 50 x 80cm - Thickness: 3cm - This microfiber bathroom mat is soft feel and comfortable. - Effective fit the ground, non-slip bottom mat.  - Machine washable and quickly dry for easy care. - Easy to clean in the hand with nothing else and air dry it. Perfect for bathrooms, toilet, shower, floor, car, kitchen also your pets will love it maybe. Warming Tips: - Before using this bath rug, please ensure the floor beneath it is both clean and dry and free from any dust, debris, water or product residue. - Our bath rugs can conveniently be thrown in hand wash. For best results, wash on cold with mild detergent and lightly tumble dry on low heat. Notes: - Due to the light and screen setting difference, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures.- Please allow slight dimension difference due to different manua","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CXzCM7lSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yewader","source_asin":"B07WMYT4D2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WMYT4D2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WMYT4D2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":373531,"name":"Deni 9760 Oval-Shaped 6-1/2-Quart Electric Pressure Cooker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8136Yaqe+WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cut cooking times up to 70-percent compared to conventional cooking methods with this 6-1/2-quart electric pressure cooker. It combines steam, heat, and pressure--while retaining all the nutrients and flavor of food--for delicious home-cooked meals like pot roast, chili, vegetable stew, chicken and rice, and more. The pressure cooker provides a removable nonstick aluminum inner cooking pot for even heat distribution, and its push-button digital control panel makes it easy to select from a variety of cooking functions. Choose the warm function to reheat or keep cooked food warm, the brown function to brown food before cooking it under pressure, the steam function to boil liquid for steaming food or cooking rice, or the slow-cook function with a 9-1/2-hour programmable timer for slowly cooking food--great for having dinner ready and waiting after a long day at the office. The appliance also offers cooking-mode indicator lights, a delay-time feature for cooking food up to eight hours later, a built-in thermostat for automatic temperature control, and three pressure settings: high (15 psi), medium (7.5 psi), and low (2.5 psi). To help ensure safe operation, the unit supplies a pressure-regulator knob, an internal pressure-release system, a locking pin to prevent the lid from being opened while under pressure, and an automatic shut-off valve that activates before pressure exceeds its maximum capacity. Other highlights include a steam-release valve for fast release of pressure, a sliding lock-and-unlock safety cover latch, and plastic side handles with finger guards for convenient transport. A user manual with recipes comes included. Housed in cool-touch brushed stainless steel, the multi-function pressure cooker measures 16 by 12-1/2 by 12-3/4 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8136Yaqe+WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deni","source_asin":"B001VEJNJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001VEJNJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001VEJNJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
