window.products.push({"id":373540,"name":"Herb Witchcraft Kit for Making Potions ~ Wiccan herb Starter kit with Wooden Box ~ Witch Apothecary Herbs ~ Magick Ritual Herbs in Bulk (Extra Large)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":110.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916mJ5aAPuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Expand your witchcraft apothecary with these 2x2\" herb bags. I've included 30 of the most commonly used herbs, used in spells for everyday witchcraft practice. This kit also includes a gorgeous wooden mortar and pestle to grind herbs for use in spell jars, or to dress candles. Also included is a short pamphlet giving some suggested uses for each of the herbs included. If you would like to trade the Mortar and Pestle for 10 extra herbs (for a total of 40 herbs) please send me a message. Extra large box measures: approx: 8.5 x 7 x 6” Large box measures: 9.1 x 6.3 x 3.0\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916mJ5aAPuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B084B79F2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084B79F2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084B79F2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":373541,"name":"Zak Designs Disney Frozen 2 Kids Water Bottle Set, 16 oz, 2pc Set & Disney Frozen 2 Reusable Plastic Bento Box (3 PCs Set, Anna & Elsa)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c5402stLL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Zak Designs Disney Frozen 2 Kids Water Bottle Set with Reusable Straws and Built in Carrying Loops, Made of Plastic, Leak-Proof Water Bottle Designs (Elsa & Anna, 16 oz, BPA-Free, 2pc Set)\"Let kids enjoy hydration with fun Disney Frozen 2 water bottles by Zak Designs! Reusable and Durable Material: Reusable water bottles will last wash after wash; good for you and good for the environment! The 16 oz water bottle is made of PP plastic, durable enough for kids to use every day. Leak-Proof Lid: The lid screws on securely and won't leak when the spout is closed, though water flows for easy drinking when the spout is open. The easy-open button has a flip-up lock to keep it from activating accidentally. On the Go: The water bottle has a built-in carrying loop on the lid for easy transportation, and with the spout cover to keep the spout clean and closed, it can be tossed into a bag for worry-free travel. Specifications: Set includes 2 water bottles. 16 oz capacity. Made of durable plastic. BPA-Free - Zak is committed to safety. Dishwasher safe, do not microwave. Length: 4.23-inch, Width: 2.75-inch, Height: 6.61-inch. Character: Anna and Elsa (Disney's Frozen 2).\"Zak Designs Disney Frozen 2 Reusable Plastic Bento Box with Leak-Proof Seal, Carrying Handle, Microwave Steam Vent, and Individual Containers for Kids' Packed Lunch (3 PCs Set, Anna & Elsa)This convenient bento box from Zak Designs makes lunchtime fun for any fan of Frozen! Durable Materials: The bento box set is made of plastic with additional silicone parts, durable enough to be used every day. All materials are dishwasher and microwave safe as well as completely BPA free. Leak-Proof and Microwave Safe: The lid has a silicone seal with two large latches to hold it securely in place and prevent leaks. It also has a vent to release steam while heating food in the microwave. Convenient and Portable: The inner divider and two individual snack containers let you organize meals while keeping different foods separate. A low-profile silicone carry handle means that lunch is easy to take on the go, and multiple bentos are designed to stack without sliding around for storage. Specifications: 3-piece lunch set contains large bento box with lid and 2 small lidded containers. Made of durable plastic with silicone seals. BPA free - Zak is committed to safety. Dishwasher and microwave safe. Large Box Dimensions: Length: 8.62 in, Width: 6.31 in, Height: 2.56 in. Small Box Dimensions: Length: 2.87 in, Width: 2.71 in, Height: 1.69 in. Character: Disney's Frozen 2 (Anna and Elsa).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c5402stLL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zak Designs","source_asin":"B09Q9DMVG7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q9DMVG7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q9DMVG7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
