window.products.push({"id":373701,"name":"Coasters with Holder, Absorbent Coasters by DSNDVES, Set of 6 Ceramic Coasters, Marble Style Drink Coasters with Cork Base, Bar Coasters, Round Stone ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iuQaWluEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁 SUPERB ABSORBENT FUNCTION:Our cup coasters are made of high quality ceramic stone surface, compared to the silicone, leather or wood coasters, it can more quickly and effectively absorb tea, coffee beer and water spills within 10-15 seconds. Keep your desktop and furniture surface dry and clean. 🎁 UNIQUE NON-SLIP CORK CASE: The ceramic coasters adopt cork base bottom design, prevent your table and furniture from scratches and scuffs. And they can stay in place well, tightly stick to the desktop. Moreover, the ceramic surface of the coaster can withstand high temperatures, preventing your table from getting burned. And compared to the silicone coasters, our absorbent coasters won’t stick to the icy glasses. 🎁 BASIC SIZE & DIVERSE OCCASION:The diameter of coasters is 4’’, and the coasters thicknesses is 0.24’’, it suits most of cups and bottles. Generous marble design is great for home, kitchen, dinning room,bathroom and hotel. In addition, the ceramic coasters can be used for placing small vases. And absorbent coasters are perfect for placing cold drinks at bars. Must be a superb helper in your daily life. 🎁 EASY STORAGE & GOOD GIFT CHOICE : This 6-pack ceramic coaster set is equipped with a mental holder, easy to store, save space and make your home tidy. In addition, the practical and exquisite coaster is not only nice for your home decor but also perfect as gifts, suitable for housewarming, birthday, wedding and Christmas. The delicate marbling design is sure to be appreciated by you. 🎁 SERVICE: DSNDVES 100% Money Back. Please feel free to contact us if our Ceramic Coasters have any question. If you are unsatisfied with cup coasters, we will give you a prompt refund or replacement. Try our best to supply the best service for every customer. And we’d love to hear your suggestion, we’ll make an effort to improve.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iuQaWluEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DSNDVES","source_asin":"B0BCKD6T7D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCKD6T7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCKD6T7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":373702,"name":"Serta Copenhagen Sofas, 78\", Stoneware Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NiHGV7aKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Designed for small living spaces, the Serta Copenhagen Collection 78\" Sofa brings functional style and affordable comfort to your home decor. A great fit for apartments, dorms and narrow spaces, its compact size and unique, tool-free design make it easy to transport and to set up exactly where you want it. In addition to making small spaces feel bigger, the soft rounded arms, refined straight back cushions and reversible accent pillows add traditional style to your living room, den or extra room. Reinforced hardwood materials, individually wrapped coils surrounded by high-density foam and poly-fibers, and pillowed back cushions deliver durability you can count on and supportive comfort you can relax into. Match this Serta sofa with another Copenhagen Collection sofa, loveseat and accent chair for a completely coordinated look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NiHGV7aKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Serta","source_asin":"B0185QVDRO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0185QVDRO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0185QVDRO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
