window.products.push({"id":373763,"name":"CHIVE ‘Caterpillar’ Bubble Bud Vase for Centerpieces — 6 Hole Multi Chamber Clear Glass Flower Vase for Short Flowers — Small, 10.25” Long","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51po59LlWnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"CHIVE INC was established over 15 years ago and they currently design and make thousands of glass and ceramic flower vases and other fun bits of home décor! In addition to all these vases they make over 200 plant pots of varying sizes, colors, materials, and textures. I am thrilled to offer on my Amazon page just a small selection of their catalog, including the most popular vase in Chive history, the Hudson Caterpillar. UNIQUE MODERN FLOWER VASE: The Caterpillar is a floral vase for 6 single flowers. Each of the 6 round clear glass balls are joined together in a row. There is no separation between the balls so you only need to fill one hole with water and you will fill the whole vase. SIMPLE ELEGANT DESIGN: This delicate and adorable bud vase is perfect for small short flowers, clippings from your garden. This light weight bud vase makes flower arranging fun and easy. Use this vase to make an elegant, low laying decorative centerpiece on your table for your next dinner party. DECORATIVE HOME DÉCOR: Achieve a dramatic effect in the center of your table while still being able to look across the table and speak to your dinner guests without a large flower arrangement in the way. Looks cute on a kitchen window sill. FLOWERS NOT INCLUDED / 10.25\" long, 1\" wide, 1.5\" tall","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51po59LlWnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHIVE","source_asin":"B07J1S1KF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J1S1KF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J1S1KF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
