window.products.push({"id":373807,"name":"GAC Tempered Glass Tray Rectangular Glass Platter Break and Chip Resistant – Oven Safe – Microwave Safe – Dishwasher Safe Decorative Plate and Glass S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nIJqq2KdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GOLD TRIM RECTANGULAR GLASS SERVING PLATTER FEATURES and BENEFITS : ✓ Unbreakable This gold rectangular platter is designed with you and your family in mind. Will not break when falls to the ground. Great advantage, especially with little ones around. ✓ Chip resistant The rectangular glass platter will not chip with heavy use. Perfect glass serving tray for daily use and hosting. ✓ Dishwasher safe This tempered glass serving tray is 3X EASIER to care for that other glass dishes since they are dishwasher safe. Cleaning is not a hassle when you serve on this glass tray and it can go straight into the dishwasher after each use. ✓ Oven Safe and Microwave safe up to 350 degrees Fahrenheit. Place this rectangle glass plate into your oven and take them straight to the table! You will have less pots and pans dirty. Fantastic for serving hot dishes and desserts on these decorative plates, it’s so simple to prepare in advance and warm them up. ✓ Elegant design It’s made of beautiful, thick, sturdy glass that can hold even heavy weight items. The design of this rectangle serving tray is beautifully crafted with a gold border. The center of the centerpiece plate is etched with frosted glass and designs. ✓ GAC products are built to last! We only manufacture items of the highest quality and design with you in mind! All our products are exclusively created for your home and kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nIJqq2KdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GAC","source_asin":"B00HHYM7TE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HHYM7TE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HHYM7TE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":373808,"name":"Mortier Pilon - Kombucha Starter Kit with Scoby - 1x Kombucha Jar + 2x Fliptop Bottles For Kombucha + Ingredients + 1x 45 Recipe Book For Homemade Kom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qds1RqlKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"WHAT’S INSIDE: 1 5L Glass Kombucha jar with silicone sleeve, lid & filter - 2 fliptop bottles - 1 reusable SCOBY – organic cane sugar (1.06 oz - 30gr) – organic black tea (1.06 oz - 30 gr) - 1 45 recipe book - 1 recipe booklet - 1 wax pencil MASTER KIT: Everything you need to start your own Kombucha is in this kit! Kombucha is simply fermented tea. Let us debunk the myths surrounding this probiotics-filled tea with easy step-by-step recipes (online & included book and booklet). HOW DOES IT WORK? You first have to settle the SCOBY in its new environment, in the kombucha crock. After 3 days you can brew Kombucha at Home for the first time. Then your SCOBY is reusable! It will continue to grow healthy and provide you with delicious Kombucha. It just requires that you never completely empty your jar. HEALTHY DIY RECIPES YOU’LL WANT TO TRY: Revisited classics with a touch of Kombucha for healthier results! Included in this kit are recipes for: strawberry-banana-kombucha smoothie, Kombucha & Maple Vinaigrette, Kombucha tonic... EASY TO CLEAN: Hand wash with liquid soap and a sponge, air dry. Effortlessly remove the silicone sleeve to wash, simply rinse the filter. DO NOT USE HOT OR BOILING WATER, GLASS COULD BREAK. DO NOT PUT IN THE DISHWASHER.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qds1RqlKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mortier Pilon","source_asin":"B07PFR69ST","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PFR69ST","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PFR69ST","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":373809,"name":"Water Bottle Organizer, 3 Tier Bamboo Water Bottle Holder, Freestanding Sturdy Water Cup Stand Storage, Stackable Water Bottle Storage for Cabinet Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711qgARxR7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you often forget where to put your water bottle? Do you have a lot of kids' bottles that need to be stored? Are you often unable to find the bottle you are looking for? A water bottle holder can solve all your worries. Suitable for kitchen countertops, pantry, cabinet water bottle storage rack has 3-tier. Not only will it save you valuable cabinet space, but the shelves also make it easier to find and grab the water bottle you’re looking for, leaving them all within arm’s reach. You can also use it to store unopened sauce/condiment bottles such as wine vinegar, BBQ sauce, cans, etc. Our bottle rack is made of high-quality bamboo with a moisture-resistant coating that makes it easier to clean and smoother. It is not only a functional storage, but also a unique decoration in your kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711qgARxR7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yiketary","source_asin":"B0B638FRM5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-373809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B638FRM5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B638FRM5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
